/*
 * Kept for content that wants to opt into the narrow column explicitly. The automatic
 * wrapping the Next.js build did in prepareMDX -- grouping every run of narrow blocks
 * into one <MaxWidth> and letting Sandpack interrupt it -- is a CSS rule on
 * `.mdx-content > *` in src/styles/index.css now, because the equivalent tree surgery
 * is not available to an Astro component: it never sees its siblings.
 */
---

<div class="max-w-4xl ml-0 2xl:mx-auto"><slot /></div>
